url: https://github.com/freddykrueger88/JobHunter
abstract: >-
  JobHunter is a fully local, AI-powered job application manager.
  Self-hosted via Docker, GDPR-compliant, no cloud required.
  Features include job search across multiple portals, AI-generated
  cover letters, ATS score checker, Kanban board, and more.
  All AI runs locally via Ollama (Mistral, LLaMA3, Phi-3).
  / JobHunter ist ein vollständig lokaler, KI-gestützter
  Bewerbungsassistent. Self-Hosted via Docker, DSGVO-konform,
  keine Cloud erforderlich.
